# {{.Name}} ({{.Type}})

The organisation's billing identity: the legal name, postal address, country, tax registration and invoice reference that appear in the **Bill To** block of your invoices. Each organisation has exactly one set of billing details, so declare at most one of these per organisation.

Creating the resource writes the details you declare; destroying it clears every declared field. The billing email is the one exception: it is never cleared, and leaving out `email` keeps the current address.

Every field is optional. Invoices are issued either way. The read-only `complete` flag only says whether the details are ready for an invoice: the entity type, the first address line, the city and the country, and also the legal name for a company.

